  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kvinnliga politikers inflytande NDI 2016-2019</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s Political Influence NDI 2016-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till kvinnors och ungdomars politiska representation och inflytande i Burkina  Faso, genom bl a utbildningar riktade mot partiledningar, ungdoms- och kvinnof&#xf6;rbund inom sex partier i parlamentet, uppmuntran av k&#xf6;nskvotering vid politiska val, genderk&#xe4;nslig budgetering i parlamentet, samt en st&#xe4;rkt koalition f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;rande  och uppf&#xf6;ljning av Convention on the elimination of all forms of discrimination against women (CEDAW).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to women&apos;s and young people&apos;s political representation and influence in Burkina Faso, through for example training of party leadership, women and youth wings in six parliamentary parties, promoting gender quota during political elections, gender-sensitive budgeting in parliament and a strengthened coalition for implementation and monitoring of the CEDAW.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the intervention conducted by NGO NDI (National Democratic Institute) is to increase women and youth&#x2019;s participation in parties and policy making.&#xa0;The specific objectives are:
- Support political parties to initiate internal reforms to make the party more inclusive;
- Assist women and youth wings to influence party policy on key issue areas;
- Support youth and women party wings to collaborate with civil society organizations (CSOs) and national legislators to advance priority issues.</narrative>
  </description>
